# The portfolio launcher uses a clean environment and does not read a .env file.
# It refuses to start while .env, .env.local, or a .env.development, .env.production or .env.test file
# (with or without .local) exists at the root, in apps/api or in apps/web.
# Optional port overrides can be supplied to the command through the shell:
# PORTFOLIO_WEB_PORT=4330
# PORTFOLIO_API_PORT=4331
# Do not put customer data, AD credentials, database URLs, or mail settings here.
